EastSun, 20260930: the extension is not "HT9045 設計檢視" -- every later
software built the same way (BCB6 forms -> web HMI + C++) is to use it.
- the names people see are generic: extension "HTML 視覺設計工具", side
  bar / editor / settings "HTML 視覺設計", command category "HTML設計",
  output channel "HTML 視覺設計", Problems source "HTML 頁面檢查"; README /
  CHEATSHEET follow, README gets "用在其他軟體"
- ids, setting keys (ht9045Designer.*), the package name stay, so existing
  settings, key bindings and saved designer state keep working
- lib/roots.js: the C++ port and the BCB6 source are found by their shape
  (tools\dfm2rc + forms\; main.dfm / main.cpp), a *_Cpp_* / *_Code_V* name
  only comes first -- no longer only HT9011UC_Cpp_* / HT9011UC_Code_V*
- lib/websearch.js: a generated wire file is one calling any XxxWire.register

He also could not find how to switch pages: the 頁面 view was hidden in his
side bar. Now:
- the status bar always shows "📄 <page> ⌄": a click opens the page picker
- the picker's first item brings the side bar's 頁面 list back; the current
  page is marked 目前
- a 切換頁面 button in the designer's title bar; the command 顯示「頁面」清單
  (the view's focus command also shows a hidden view); the components
  view's welcome text links both

Tests: lib (a made-up Mach7_Port / Mach7_BCB6 layout found by shape), smoke
(the status bar item, the picker's first item focuses the 頁面 view, this
page marked), real VS Code (the command shows the 頁面 view, the status bar
item, the output channel's new name).

